    "Execution under Dawn Fulfillment bounces 4 times (5 targets total). Phase 3 (DISCRIMINATING) verifies all four",
    "Sunslam ticks (805639) under Dawn Fulfillment each bounce 4 times (16 total 803493 casts), never bouncing onto",
    "the primary target or a distant control dummy 22 yd away."
